600
00:30:16,290 --> 00:30:18,560
I'm looking forward to it, and she can pull it off as Renan.

601
00:30:19,560 --> 00:30:22,560
Koo Young, I'll make you regret choosing me as the Worst.

602
00:30:23,430 --> 00:30:24,690
