609
00:30:40,410 --> 00:30:41,740
It's scary.

610
00:30:41,880 --> 00:30:43,110
I'm curious about the performance.

611
00:30:43,250 --> 00:30:44,250
This is interesting.

612
00:30:45,420 --> 00:30:47,020
Did she feel that much fear while dancing?

613
00:30:47,050 --> 00:30:48,890
But she isn't the one who's scared right now.

614
00:30:49,420 --> 00:30:51,450
Or is she? Is it just her standing in front of the public?

615
00:30:52,590 --> 00:30:58,860
The dark moments I experienced while doing "SWF: Directors' War."

616
00:30:58,900 --> 00:31:02,730
With a final score of nine to zero, Simeez.

617
00:31:02,800 --> 00:31:05,870
It was so upsetting when things failed, and it was really hard.

618
00:31:05,900 --> 00:31:07,470
