Wait, should I try expressing those emotions in the intro?

630
00:31:36,100 --> 00:31:40,399
The struggle from anxiety and having to win.

631
00:31:40,400 --> 00:31:43,170
I wanted to express that, so I recorded it in Japanese.

632
00:31:44,140 --> 00:31:49,410
(I teared up so many times, and I hit a wall.)

633
