637
00:32:04,430 --> 00:32:07,200
After that, it gets a bit bizarre, like a real ghost in a horror movie.

638
00:32:07,230 --> 00:32:11,069
If I create a Wow Factor and make it scary,

639
00:32:11,070 --> 00:32:12,699
I think it'll be fun. Please look forward to it.

640
00:32:12,700 --> 00:32:13,740
(Look Forward To It)

641
00:32:14,200 --> 00:32:17,270
She put in a lot of effort, but I think I can win.

642
00:32:17,510 --> 00:32:19,410
I think I'll win. I'm confident.

643
00:32:20,110 --> 00:32:22,680
