- She's starting, she's starting.

648
00:32:33,190 --> 00:32:35,360
Oh. She must be nervous.

649
00:32:35,390 --> 00:32:37,460
I wanted her to do well, so I cheered for her.

650
00:32:37,490 --> 00:32:40,100
I thought Renan's performance could be a game-changer, so...

651
