652
00:32:44,700 --> 00:32:47,400
(Concept: A stage expressing emotions experienced while dancing)

653
00:32:52,210 --> 00:32:54,580
Wow, this is going to be amazing.

654
00:32:57,480 --> 00:32:58,480
(Exclaiming)

655
00:32:58,480 --> 00:32:59,480
(Focused)

656
00:32:59,480 --> 00:33:00,480
I love this.

657
00:33:02,320 --> 00:33:03,550
Wow, she really went all out.

658
00:33:05,090 --> 00:33:06,920
Ah, Renan really meant business.

659
00:33:07,090 --> 00:33:08,460
The tension is incredible.

660
00:33:09,530 --> 00:33:10,590
