665
00:33:24,710 --> 00:33:26,440
(Getting goosebumps)

666
00:33:29,280 --> 00:33:31,380
- Oh my gosh.
- My goodness.

667
00:33:36,290 --> 00:33:38,050
Gosh, this is crazy.

668
00:33:45,160 --> 00:33:46,660
- Amazing.
- Let's go!

669
00:33:52,800 --> 00:33:54,040
This is truly amazing.

670
00:34:02,040 --> 00:34:03,050
So cool.

671
00:34:07,120 --> 00:34:08,120
(Nice)

672
00:34:09,020 --> 00:34:10,190
She used lasers.

673
00:34:10,420 --> 00:34:11,750
That's absolutely incredible.

674
00:34:14,020 --> 00:34:15,490
I think she used the lasers really well.

675
00:34:20,800 --> 00:34:21,859
(Yes!)

676
00:34:21,860 --> 00:34:22,900
(Exclaiming)

677
00:34:52,090 --> 00:34:53,830
She put this together in 24 hours?

678
00:34:53,860 --> 00:34:56,030
- That's truly amazing.
- Oh, she did so well.

679
00:34:56,070 --> 00:34:57,570
Wow, this actually works.

680
00:34:57,600 --> 00:35:01,700
What I thought would never work came together, and I felt relieved.

681
00:35:02,710 --> 00:35:04,410
(She killed it.)

682
00:35:04,970 --> 00:35:07,110
