687
00:35:18,220 --> 00:35:23,459
It must've been hard to create this within 24 hours.

688
00:35:23,460 --> 00:35:24,929
Without giving up...

689
00:35:24,930 --> 00:35:28,659
The fact that she took on the challenge to make it better...

690
00:35:28,660 --> 00:35:30,370
