691
00:35:30,870 --> 00:35:36,239
There were parts that were really acrobatic.

692
00:35:36,240 --> 00:35:40,809
Especially in the beginning part where they dragged a dancer...

693
00:35:40,810 --> 00:35:43,479
It really gave me goosebumps.

694
00:35:43,480 --> 00:35:47,149
The fear and anxiety Renan wanted to express...

695
00:35:47,150 --> 00:35:50,150
I could totally feel it.

696
00:35:50,350 --> 00:35:51,919
About the music,

697
00:35:51,920 --> 00:35:56,760
