698
00:35:57,060 --> 00:36:01,300
(I got here after tearing up and hitting walls so many times.)

699
00:36:01,500 --> 00:36:03,599
I could see that you fully expressed your thoughts.

700
00:36:03,600 --> 00:36:06,299
Since I know Japanese, from that part,

701
00:36:06,300 --> 00:36:09,409
I was really into it.

702
00:36:09,410 --> 00:36:10,410
Thank you.`

703
00:36:11,010 --> 00:36:14,139
I was so grateful that they recognised that and brought it up.

704
00:36:14,140 --> 00:36:17,250
It felt amazing. Is this a dream?

705
00:36:17,450 --> 00:36:20,650
I was anxious. As soon as I heard her evaluation, I felt so anxious.

706
00:36:20,820 --> 00:36:23,750
