711
00:36:35,700 --> 00:36:39,640
Personally, I wished you kept going with that.

712
00:36:39,900 --> 00:36:42,810
Gosh, this shouldn't be happening. What do I do?

713
00:36:43,770 --> 00:36:45,240
I think I watched it feeling a bit on edge.

714
00:36:45,710 --> 00:36:48,540
It did feel like as soon as the dancers were off the table,

715
00:36:48,640 --> 00:36:50,810
