722
00:37:06,900 --> 00:37:11,000
With that in mind, this performance could be done without the prop.

723
00:37:11,030 --> 00:37:15,100
I think it was a performance that could work without the prop.

724
00:37:15,500 --> 00:37:17,070
I'm so upset.

725
00:37:17,110 --> 00:37:21,680
Since I was already worried, I think my anxiety was even greater.

726
00:37:21,710 --> 00:37:24,979
Renan's performance definitely lacked a strong advantage...

727
00:37:24,980 --> 00:37:26,950
