728
00:37:27,050 --> 00:37:28,880
I think I have a very good chance of winning.

729
00:37:29,020 --> 00:37:31,890
Performance-wise, I believe I'll win.

730
00:37:32,090 --> 00:37:35,419
Other than that, the final choreography was really good.

731
00:37:35,420 --> 00:37:39,029
You pulled off something not just anyone can do.

732
00:37:39,030 --> 00:37:40,630
You should be truly proud of yourself.

733
00:37:42,160 --> 00:37:43,400
Thank you.

734
00:37:43,600 --> 00:37:46,700
Rather than feeling disappointed, I worked hard with no regrets.

735
00:37:46,800 --> 00:37:48,340
(Renan, great job!)

736
00:37:48,500 --> 00:37:50,670
Still, she did her absolute best. Oh, man.

737
00:37:50,710 --> 00:37:53,680
But it really drew you in that much.

738
00:37:53,710 --> 00:37:55,780
You could feel the sincerity in it, you know what I mean?

739
00:37:55,810 --> 00:38:00,820
The next Last Stage choreographer is JEONG MIN JUN.

740
00:38:01,120 --> 00:38:02,690
(Next is JEONG MIN JUN.)

741
00:38:03,820 --> 00:38:06,090
