743
00:38:09,990 --> 00:38:12,190
Because of the results MIN JUN has shown so far,

744
00:38:12,230 --> 00:38:15,360
I anticipated it even more than the rehearsal run-through.

745
00:38:15,400 --> 00:38:17,170
MIN JUN is a genius.

746
00:38:17,200 --> 00:38:19,170
He's so good at dancing.

747
00:38:19,270 --> 00:38:21,240
I won't be eliminated. Never.

748
00:38:21,600 --> 00:38:24,270
What's the stage concept for JEONG MIN JUN's Last Stage?

749
00:38:24,310 --> 00:38:29,210
I used the Heungnam Evacuation from "Ode to My Father" as a motif,

750
00:38:29,310 --> 00:38:31,650
Sean, do you know this movie?

751
00:38:31,850 --> 00:38:33,920
Yes. I saw it a long time ago.

752
00:38:34,020 --> 00:38:35,180
Is it an old movie?

753
00:38:35,420 --> 00:38:38,850
It was the intro scene of the movie "Ode to My Father."

754
00:38:38,890 --> 00:38:43,060
Let's direct the events during the evacuation in the Korean War.

755
00:38:43,090 --> 00:38:47,160
Since it's an evacuation, I also ended up evacuating.

756
00:38:47,200 --> 00:38:50,770
I couldn't really accept being in the Last Stage.

757
00:38:50,800 --> 00:38:53,970
The reason I was eliminated in the "Title Sequence Film Mission..."

758
00:38:54,070 --> 00:38:55,099
